{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Let Your [E]people sing. What a [F#m]glorious [F#m9]thing
To hear [E/G#]the prais[A]es of Your child[Bsus]ren!
[B]As our [E]voices soar toward Your [F#m]throne, O [F#m9]LORD,
Reveal [E/G#]to us [A]Your holy pre[Bsus]sence.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[B]God, Your peace [Aadd2]is perfect and true.
[Esus2]And Your grace [Aadd2]is making our hearts [E]brand new.
[B]Through Your Word we come to know [C#m7]You,
And [B]we sing to show [Amaj7]our love [B]for You.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[E]Let Your people sing. Let the [F#m]heavens [F#m9]ring
With the mu[E/G#]sic of all [A]Your sons and daugh[Bsus]ters.
[B]Crafting [E]songs of praise from our [F#m]hearts [F#m9]ablaze
With the love [E/G#]of Your child[A]ren for their Fa[Bsus]ther.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[E]Halle[A]lu[E]jah. Halle[A]lu[E]jah.
Halle[A]lu[E]jah. Halle[A]lu[E]jah.
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[E]God, Your peace [Aadd2]is perfect and true.
[Esus2]And Your grace [Aadd2]is making our hearts [E]brand new.
[B]Though our words [Aadd2]could [B]never explain [C#m7]You,
We [B]cannot contain [Amaj7]our love [B]for You.
[C#m]So we sing to show [Amaj7]our love [B]for You.
